  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas South Sudan Implementation plan for strenthening systems in Operations.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas South Sudan is dedicated to creating and maintaining a safe, responsible and sustainable operational environment that aligns with its mission to support to support the regions vulnerable populations. 
Overall Objective: To enhance Caritas South Sudan&apos;s operational integrity and effectiveness by establishing strong safeguarding measures, strengthening governance frameworks, improving audit and financial management practices and developing sustainable strategies.
Main areas of focus will be:
- Strengthening Safeguarding.
- Strengthening Governance Structure
- Improving Audit and Financial Management
- Sustainability Plan 
As a member of the Caritas Internationalis CTP will contribute towards the development of policies as part of strengthening the governance structure to enable CSS to achieve their objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
